Z||000001||Ed||12-24-2001||02:08 PM||||Go to //groups.yahoo.com/group/quadforum  and join up for Quad 4 information.  <P>I looked at a car with a '88 quad four already installed, but the notorious head gasket failure gave me pause.  I understand there's a better gasket now available which reduces the failure rate.    ||||reg||1
